<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telesp 8-mo net 511 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telesp 8-mo net 511 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecoms firm Telesp, a unit of federally owned Telebras serving Sao Paulo state, released the following figures for 1996's first eight months.</p>
<p>		   Jan-Aug 1996	Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Net	     511 million	     148 million</p>
<p>    Revenues	2.3 bln	     1.39 bln</p>
<p>    Shr net	 N/A		   N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
</text>
